a-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2995f1052910e064\" href=\"?note=2995f1052910e064\" title=\"29-thm-trakhtenbrot\">29-thm-trakhtenbrot</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"原定位p.22/scan37保留；内部支持29-thm-trakhtenbrot"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-cross-checked; not-machine-verified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 遍历 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a> 的有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\">\\(g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" href=\"?note=a7fafe8aaa1edd6c\" title=\"29-df-godel-numbering\">29-df-godel-numbering</a>。有限结构非空。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a1f1e7424c0c2277\" href=\"?note=a1f1e7424c0c2277\" title=\"29-df-computability\">29-df-computability</a> 定义。</li>\n<li>内部支持条目为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2995f1052910e064\" href=\"?note=2995f1052910e064\" title=\"29-thm-trakhtenbrot\">29-thm-trakhtenbrot</a>；该条显式陈述所有 RE 集合向有限可满足代码集的全可计算多一归约，不能只用不可判定性替代完全性前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trahtenbrot}\\vdash\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\\;\\Biggl(\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\\Longrightarrow\\bigl\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;(A\\models\\varphi)\\bigr\\}\\in\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trahtenbrot}\\vdash\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\\;\\Biggl(\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\\Longrightarrow\\bigl\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;(A\\models\\varphi)\\bigr\\}\\in\\mathrm{REComplete}_{\\leq_m}\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trahtenbrot}\\vdash\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\\;\\Biggl(\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\\Longrightarrow\\bigl\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;(A\\models\\varphi)\\bigr\\}\\notin\\mathrm{RE}\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}trahtenbrot}\\vdash\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{GNum}(S)\\;\\Biggl(\\exists R\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(S)\\;\\operatorname{ar}(R)\\geq2\\Longrightarrow\\bigl\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner_g\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[S]\\;(A\\models\\varphi)\\bigr\\}\\notin\\mathrm{RE}\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件名中的历史拼写 trahtenbrot，避免打断现有调用。原悬空上游改为本书内正确拼写的重建目标 trakhtenbrot；这不是已有文件改名。关系符号必须至少二元；常量不能满足此条件。</p>\n<p>原条目把 RE 完全性标记为未核对的强化；内部支持条目现在给出精确归约量词及核对书目。本文仍是形式化数学陈述而不是提交给证明助手检查的证明；没有将 eligible_as_verified_dependency 改成 true。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-computability","status":"resolved","id":"a1f1e7424c0c2277","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-computability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"t